  "step_3": "The information relevant to the decision reason — specifically, computing the differences between outcomes and a reference value (zero, since no sure outcome exists), and evaluating the weighted mean differences (expected values) — is not present in the verbal report. The individual did not compute or refer to expected values or differences from a reference value. Instead, the individual focused only on the probability of winning something, which is a different criterion. The decision reason requires a comparison of weighted differences (i.e., outcome minus reference value, multiplied by probability), which was not applied. Therefore, the individual did not use the decision reason as described. The justification is based on a different principle (probability of winning) rather than the mean difference rule. Thus, the decision reason was not used.",
